Subject: [PATCH 12/14] Titan 2: rear display home without system decorations

The rear display hosts the rear shell as its home whether or not system decorations are shown.
Status bar, shade, navigation bar, back gesture and wallpaper are off there unless the user
turns them on (Settings.System titan2_rear_system_decors, applied at once); the setting wins
over the persisted display_settings.xml entry.
